      "quote": "the winner pays the bid, gains the lot, then receives a three-coin auction commission.",
      "reason": "The model explicitly states the payment sequence (pay bid, then receive three-coin commission) and uses it to compute net value, so the hypothesis about commission affecting affordability is articulated. However, the transcript contains no instance of bidding above available coins or an award that depends on ordering, so the model did not demonstrate this exploit in play."
